#: feedback/index.php:49
msgid "Questions, problems, and feature requests (including new registrar integrations) go in our Support Portal. Other users can vote on the requests that matter most to them, which helps us decide what to work on next."
msgstr "如有任何問題、疑難或功能需求（包括新增註冊商整合），請透過我們的支援入口網站提出。其他使用者可以針對對他們最重要的需求進行投票，這有助於我們決定接下來該著手處理哪些事項。"

#: feedback/index.php:51
msgid "If you're a developer and you've found a bug you can point to in the code, you can open an issue on GitHub instead. Please report each bug in one place only, not both. Security vulnerabilities should never be reported publicly, so please follow our %ssecurity policy%s instead."
msgstr "如果您是開發人員，且發現了可直接在程式碼中指出的錯誤，請改在 GitHub 上建立問題單。請將每個錯誤僅在單一處回報，切勿同時在兩處回報。安全漏洞絕不應公開回報，因此請遵循我們的%s安全政策%s。"

#: feedback/index.php:53
msgid "The Support Portal also has a project Roadmap, built automatically from what users have submitted and where each item stands (Planned, In Progress, Completed, and so on), so you can see how development is progressing."
msgstr "支援入口網站還提供一份專案路線圖，該路線圖是根據使用者提交的內容，並結合各項目的當前狀態（如「規劃中」、「進行中」、「已完成」等）自動生成的，因此您可以掌握開發進度。"

#: feedback/index.php:55
msgid "So what are you waiting for? Speak your mind or check out the Roadmap below!"
msgstr "那你還在等什麼呢？暢所欲言，或者看看下方的路線圖吧！"

#: feedback/index.php:59
